#X floatatom 260 4404 6 0 2 0 - - -;
#X msg 260 4428 kbd \$1;
#X text 82 4458 cut (99): 0-99 = 66 Hz - 20 kHz \, 13 steps per octave. \; res (0): 0-15 \, an uncompensated ladder (the bass falls as it rises) \, no self-oscillation. \; kbd (0): key tracking of the highest key: 0 off \, 2 full (1:1 \, C4 nominal) \, 1 half (1:2 \, C6 nominal)., f 64;
#X obj 460 4566 s \$0-pdoly8;
